OL,3,GNEWSAThree more arrests over disorder
OL,4,Aat Celtic title party
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree more men have been arrested over
OL,7,Fdisorder in Glasgow city centre as
OL,8,Ffootball fans celebrated Celtic's
OL,9,FPremiership title win.
OL,11,FThe trouble in May saw two officers
OL,12,Fseriously injured and three members of
OL,13,Fthe public requiring hospital treatment
OL,14,Fas a result of violence and anti-social
OL,15,Fbehaviour at the Trongate.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
