OL,3,GNEWSAThree more arrests over disorder
OL,4,Aat Celtic title party
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating the disorder
OL,7,Fattended addresses in Glasgow,
OL,8,FRutherglen and Greenock earlier, and
OL,9,Farrested three men - aged 33, 35 and 37
OL,10,F- over offences including assault,
OL,11,Fbreach of the peace and culpable and
OL,12,Freckless conduct.
OL,14,FIt brings the total number of arrests
OL,15,Fto 47, with some of them subsequently
OL,16,Fcharged over the disorder.
